data: {"id": "f960fe074cfd4122-thinking-parallel_evidence-1706", "run_id": "f960fe074cfd4122", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实（工具结果）\n\n1. **Prometheus 指标（instant）**\n   - `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`：value=1，labels 含 `reason=\"ContainerCreating\"`，确认容器处于 ContainerCreating。\n   - `kube_pod_status_phase`：Pending=1，Running=0，Failed/Succeeded/Unknown=0，与 describe 的 Pending 一致。\n   - `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`：0，说明该容器尚未成功启动过。\n\n2. **kubectl describe pod**\n   - Pod 状态：**Pending**（ContainersReady=False，PodScheduled=True）。\n   - 容器 `app` 状态：**Waiting (Reason: ContainerCreating)**。\n   - 关键事件：\n     ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788431402308, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

