g 状态无法重启\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` 的容器启动被阻塞，因为 Multus CNI 插件依赖一个不存在的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源（名称：`unavailable-network`）。\n\n- **故障机制**：Pod 配置中引用了名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络附件定义，但该资源在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中未创建。\n- **证据支撑**：Kubelet 事件 `fact-092e67d3d4cd` 显示 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 根本原因为 Multus 找不到该网络定义；Multus 事件 `fact-015d3f441525` 连续 47 次报出 `NoNetworkFound` 错误；Metric `fact-295ebd86e836` 确认 Pod 持续处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态。\n- **结论**：缺失的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源是导致当前 Pod 无法启动的直接且唯一根因。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 10.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 29.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 557.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v: 557.5s (Evidence 548.3s, RCA 9.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 600.919, "metrics": {"run_id": "f960fe074cfd4122", "mttr": {"value": "10.0m", "seconds": 600.9248070716858, "pass": false, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率